From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:13:06 +0100
Subject: Accept any getaddrinfo error in the ftp_ssl_connect_error test

Without network access the name resolution fails with "Temporary failure
in name resolution" instead of "Name or service not known". Backport of
upstream commit 17d76e530de (PHP 7.4.0).
---
 ext/ftp/tests/ftp_ssl_connect_error.phpt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ext/ftp/tests/ftp_ssl_connect_error.phpt b/ext/ftp/tests/ftp_ssl_connect_error.phpt
index 85fcf76..b0ece5d 100644
--- a/ext/ftp/tests/ftp_ssl_connect_error.phpt
+++ b/ext/ftp/tests/ftp_ssl_connect_error.phpt
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@ echo "===DONE===\n";
 
 -- Testing ftp_ssl_connect() function on failure --
 
-Warning: ftp_ssl_connect(): php_network_getaddresses: getaddrinfo failed: Name or service not known in %s on line %d
+Warning: ftp_ssl_connect(): php_network_getaddresses: getaddrinfo failed: %s in %s on line %d
 bool(false)
 
 -- Testing ftp_ssl_connect() function invalid argument type --
